  "content": "<section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/202276163477767.jpg\" alt=\"1\" title=\"1\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/2022761644456471.jpg\" alt=\"1\" title=\"1\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.7;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">在《综合医院建筑设计规范》中提出，将人工智能、大数据分析、物联网、云计算等新兴信息技术与医院后勤运维服务深度融合，推进医院运维标准化建设。智慧医院后勤运维将会是改善现代医疗服务的重要内容，也是推进医院信息化建设，提升人民群众就医体验的重要手段。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">智慧医院后勤运维管理系统应以医院三维模型为载体，对医院内所有设施设备进行全生命周期运维管理，最大限度地节约能耗资源，确保运维体系的高效运转，提供安全、健康、适用的使用空间，同时强化医院后勤运维效率并通过能效管理实现“智慧运维”和“绿色医院”。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:20px 0px 10px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;justify-content:center;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;visibility:visible;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-width:0px 1px 1px 0px;border-color:#3e3e3e #9e9e9e #9e9e9e #3e3e3e;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:flex-start;visibility:visible;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\"><section style=\"margin:-3px 0px 2px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;justify-content:center;transform:translate3d(-4px, 0px, 0px);display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;visibility:visible;\"><section style=\"margin:-3px 0px 2px;padding:7px 12px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;width:306.076px;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:#9e9e9e;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;background-color:#008fdb;align-self:flex-start;visibility:visible;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:18px;color:#ffffff;text-align:justify;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\">数字孪生医院后勤运维管理平台</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.7;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">古河云科技自研的“开河”数字化云支撑平台，以中台化思想、云架构理念为核心，依托物联网、数字孪生、云计算、AI等前沿科技技术，围绕集成接入、技术支撑、业务应用、产品矩阵、解决方案等五大维度进行产品技术整合，构建起一套能够融合各类三方软硬件系统并且适用于全业务应用场景的数字化底层支撑平台。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/202276164588141.jpg\" alt=\"2\" title=\"2\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.7;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">围绕医院后勤运维管理中出现的后勤业务信息系统建设不完善、运行数据采集不完整、各子系统无法协同运维，运维效率低成本高；后勤保障要求高，业务分支繁杂管理难度大；建筑能源消耗大，绿色节能难落实等问题，从“高效运维、绿色医院、安全舒适”的理念出发，基于 “开河”数字化云支撑平台倾力打造出集智慧后勤管理、安全运维监测管理、能耗监测管理等功能于一体的数字孪生医院后勤运维管理平台。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/202276164596191.jpg\" alt=\"3\" title=\"3\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;text-align:center;justify-content:center;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom:4px solid #008fdb;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-top:0px solid #3e3e3e;border-top-left-radius:0px;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:flex-end;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:4px;text-align:justify;color:#008fdb;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\">智慧后勤运维管理</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;line-height:1.7;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">平台将医院内的各个科室房间甚至设施设备具体位置等物理信息分布情况1:1真实还原在医院三维模型上，支持楼层、房间单独查看。同时将各设施设备运行态势信息显示在三维模型上，实现医院后勤运维可视化管理，提高后勤运维管理效率。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:2px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;vertical-align:bottom;width:auto;background-color:;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:#008fdb;align-self:flex-end;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !importan